OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on M25 due to tunnel
OL,4,Adefect
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are delays of about 90 minutes on
OL,7,Fthe M25, due to one of the tunnels at
OL,8,Fthe Dartford Crossing being closed
OL,9,Fafter a defect was found during
OL,10,Fovernight works.
OL,12,FNational Highways said it was found
OL,13,Fduring overnight works, meaning it
OL,14,Fcould not reopen at 05:00 GMT as was
OL,15,Fscheduled.
OL,17,FIt said that the east bore of the
OL,18,Ftunnel will remain closed "until
OL,19,Frepairs have been carried out", with
OL,20,Fspecialist repair crews attending on
OL,21,FMonday morning.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
