OL,4,Adefect
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are approximately eight miles on
OL,7,Fcongestion on the approach, with
OL,8,Ftraffic going back to junction four for
OL,9,FOrpington on the anticlockwise
OL,10,Fcarriageway,
